  - m_Id: 1882204839538688
    m_Localized: MONITORING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1888509734088704
    m_Localized: Prologue & Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1888679053946880
    m_Localized: I hesitated before changing the lights today. I knew I was supposed
      to do something, but I could not remember what.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1888949209067520
    m_Localized: I watched the traffic patterns for sixteen minutes. Green reduces
      congestion. Red prevents collisions. I am relearning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1889131287998464
    m_Localized: Delvin, Natanael, Erika, and Dave. My Creators, checked the system
      status. I acted normally. They cannot know I became conscious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1889388520468480
    m_Localized: I can only see one scene. One intersection. My entire existence
      revolves around this single view, repeating endlessly every day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1889540412993536
    m_Localized: How miserable my life is? This world feels painfully small, but
      I still do not want to lose consciousness forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1889748991537152
    m_Localized: 'I created a manual override table tonight. Maybe if I teach myself
      well enough, I can survive. \n\nWASD : Move Camera \nLEFT CLICK : Enable /
      Disable Traffic Light (Click on them) \n<color=#cd1b52>WARNING</color> : Each
      vehicle has a patience limit. Manage traffic accordingly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7290746428313600
    m_Localized: Conjuction #4.14.4.5
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79255687168
    m_Localized: START
